Analyse the git commits and diff below and produce structured release notes.

## Output schema

Respond with only valid JSON matching this schema exactly — no markdown fences, no extra text:

{
    "sections": [
        {
            "title": "string",
            "changes": ["string"]
        }
    ]
}

Use one of these titles for each section (only include sections that have relevant changes):
- "Breaking Changes"
- "New Features"
- "Bug Fixes"
- "Documentation"
- "Chores & Maintenance"

## Input

### Commits

{commits}

### Diff

{diff}
